WEBVTT

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.230
Hi there!

00:00:01.253 --> 00:00:03.790
This lesson is for accountants and accounting firms.

00:00:03.997 --> 00:00:06.030
Tositeo is free for accountants.

00:00:06.217 --> 00:00:08.430
All your clients are on one workspace:

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.953
who has receipts waiting to be booked, who is missing records,

00:00:11.903 --> 00:00:15.150
you see it right away, without messaging each person to ask.

00:00:15.771 --> 00:00:20.359
On the sign-up page, choose the Accountant tab, then create your account as usual.

00:00:20.711 --> 00:00:22.519
The accounting firm name is optional.

00:00:22.761 --> 00:00:25.879
Once you log in, you go straight to the Accountant workspace.

00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:29.009
The Overview page shows the number of clients,

00:00:28.959 --> 00:00:33.075
the receipts and travel claims to book, and the payments without a receipt,

00:00:33.105 --> 00:00:34.835
added up across all clients.

00:00:35.245 --> 00:00:38.572
The Needs attention list puts the clients with the most work first,

00:00:38.522 --> 00:00:39.795
each with an Open button.

00:00:40.394 --> 00:00:42.696
When a business invites you as its accountant,

00:00:42.646 --> 00:00:44.604
the Overview page tells you right away.

00:00:44.872 --> 00:00:47.484
Go to Connection requests, then click Accept.

00:00:47.799 --> 00:00:49.564
That business joins your client list.

00:00:50.174 --> 00:00:52.060
Clients lists every client:

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:57.500
country, business ID, receipts to book, travel claims, and missing receipts.

00:00:57.928 --> 00:01:01.500
Each client can be in a different country, and use a different currency.

00:01:01.929 --> 00:01:04.220
Click Open to work inside the client's company.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.570
Click Export to download their data,

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:09.660
and Remind to e-mail the client about missing receipts.

00:01:10.249 --> 00:01:14.236
To bring a new client onto Tositeo, scroll down to Add client.

00:01:14.497 --> 00:01:18.167
Choose the country, enter the business ID, the company name,

00:01:18.117 --> 00:01:19.676
and the contact's e-mail.

00:01:20.025 --> 00:01:24.156
If the company already uses Tositeo, its admins are asked to accept you.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:28.716
If not, Tositeo creates the company, and sends the client an invitation.

00:01:29.318 --> 00:01:30.483
More people in your firm?

00:01:30.789 --> 00:01:34.803
Go to Accountants, enter your colleague's e-mail, and click Send invitation.

00:01:35.206 --> 00:01:38.563
Everyone logs in with their own account, and sees all the firm's clients.

00:01:39.176 --> 00:01:43.468
The Booking queue gathers the sent receipts of all your clients into one list,

00:01:43.418 --> 00:01:45.697
which you can filter by client or status.

00:01:45.961 --> 00:01:50.720
When you've booked them in your accounting software, tick them, or click Select all,

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:52.177
then click Mark as booked.

00:01:52.606 --> 00:01:55.937
To check each receipt carefully, click Book one by one.

00:01:56.165 --> 00:01:57.617
We'll learn that in the next lesson.

00:01:57.869 --> 00:01:59.297
Now take the quiz below.
